0. Create a GCP Project 

1. Configure Docker authentication
   $ gcloud auth configure-docker asia-south2-docker.pkg.dev
    {
    "credHelpers": {
        "us-central1-docker.pkg.dev": "gcloud",
        "asia-south2-docker.pkg.dev": "gcloud"
    }
    }
    Adding credentials for: asia-south2-docker.pkg.dev
    gcloud credential helpers already registered correctly


2. Create Artifact Registry repository 
        [GCP > Artifact Registry > https://console.cloud.google.com/artifacts]

    $ gcloud artifacts repositories create ecommerce-nodejs-app-repo \
        --repository-format=docker \
        --location=asia-south2 \
        --description="Microservices Nodejs"

    Created repository [ecommerce-nodejs-app-repo].

    Verify
    $ gcloud artifacts repositories list --location=asia-south2    

    ARTIFACT_REGISTRY
    REPOSITORY: ecommerce-nodejs-app-repo
